Put a City-schema GeoIP database here (MaxMind GeoLite2-City.mmdb or the DB-IP
equivalent) and uncomment GEOIP_DB_PATH in env/collector.env.

The compose file mounts this directory into the collector read-only. It is
empty on purpose: neither database may be redistributed, so neither can be
committed. Without one, every event carries null geo — a degradation, never a
failure.
